    "answer": {
      "short": "The product sequence is geometric with common ratio $rs$, where $r$ and $s$ are the common ratios of the original sequences.\n\nMultiply the two constant ratios of consecutive terms.",
      "worked": "Let the common ratios be $r$ and $s$. Then $\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=r$ and $\\dfrac{b_{n+1}}{b_n}=s$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a_{n+1}b_{n+1}}{a_nb_n}&=\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\\cdot\\frac{b_{n+1}}{b_n}\\\\\\frac{a_{n+1}b_{n+1}}{a_nb_n}&=rs.\\end{align*}$$\nThe ratio of consecutive product terms is constant, so the product sequence is geometric.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 42
